# E770 draft - legacy Autotools libpng probe and link closure
id:                     E770
trigger_tool:           configure|make|ld|runtime
phase:                  configuration|linking|runtime
error_signature:        No package 'libpng12' found|undefined symbol: png_|undefined symbol: jpeg_|undefined symbol: uncompress

severity:               3
category:               ohos, autotools, libpng, shared-library, linkage
match_keywords:         libtwin, libpng12, libpng, libpng16, PNG_LIBS, JPEG_LIBS, Z_LIBS, LIBADD, DT_NEEDED
title:                  Update legacy libpng discovery and close the shared-library dependency chain

root_cause:             Old Autotools projects can probe only libpng12 while the published dependency provides libpng 1.6. Even after discovery succeeds, the main libtool library may omit PNG/JPEG/zlib from its LIBADD and therefore contain unresolved imports with no DT_NEEDED entries, leaving consumers unable to load it reliably.
affected_scope:         Legacy Autotools graphics libraries using bundled generated configure/Makefile.in and optional image codecs.
verification_cmd:       conan create archives/l/libtwin/13.05.03.15.06-g287d16c --user=ohpcd --channel=stable -pr:h=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ci/conan/profiles/ohos-aarch64

rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           update-pkg-config-probe-and-libtool-libadd
rec_description:        Change the source configure.ac probe to libpng, apply the same change to shipped configure when autoreconf is absent, update removed libpng APIs, and add existing dependency flags to the library's LIBADD in both Makefile.am and shipped Makefile.in. Verify DT_NEEDED and run a linked consumer.
rec_command:            readelf -d libtwin.so | grep NEEDED
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               source-patch

fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      regenerate-autotools-files
fallback_description:   If a compatible autoreconf toolchain is available, regenerate configure and Makefile.in from the updated Autotools sources instead of patching bundled generated files.
fallback_command:
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          autotools-bootstrap

forbid_1_pattern:       disable.*png.*jpeg|ignore.*undefined.*symbol|skip.*consumer.*test
forbid_1_reason:        Published image dependencies are available, and successful compilation alone does not prove the shared library's dependency closure.
forbid_1_consequence:   The library silently loses supported image features or fails when loaded by consumers.

principles:             P013,P014
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             E007
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []

doc_file:               doc/E770.md
last_updated:           2026-09-27
source_event:           libtwin native OHOS/aarch64 Autotools and Conan create
authors:                2501_91199785
source_pr:
source_commit:

metrics_success_count:  1
metrics_fail_count:     1
metrics_confidence:     0.5
metrics_last_used:      2026-09-27

